# CTK Documentation Bootstrap

This generated view combines CTK's Concept navigation with the Documentation
Resolver. Use `ctk docs resolve <terms...>` to find candidates and
`ctk docs show <canonical-identity-or-path>` to read one detailed document.
Resolve searches maintained document metadata, not document bodies. Use an
exported Bundle with a repository search tool when full-text search is needed.

